---
Change a game's settings

Usage: zaun edit [OPTIONS] <GAME>

Arguments:
  <GAME>  The game

Options:
      --runtime <RUNTIME>  Compatibility layer: `default`, `umu-proton`, `ge-proton`, a build name, or the absolute path of a Proton directory
  -v, --verbose...         Increase log verbosity (-v debug, -vv trace)
      --no-follow-updates  Keep using the current build of the channel instead of following its updates
  -h, --help               Print help
